# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/np1-fastlane window (the lone-user padded round; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/np1-fastlane and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-np1-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-np1-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# C2_MODEL_REPO / C2_MODEL_REVISION (qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): a job that carries them serves the Swift checkpoint (what production serves) from its own converted-weight directory; the keys are the same
# in every serving job of this pack, so each pair differs by the profile alone.
# L2 (TIMED, the ARM of the second decode ABAB pair): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-np1, the approved ship-4 profile with the gate marker in place of
# its owner waiver id and QWEN_FAST_SOLO_PACKED=1, the same tests as C2, on Swift. TIMED: the ARC runner sets are at ZERO for this job (ORDER.txt, ARC-ZERO); no build, no
# CI push, no other job beside it. READ: c2_smoke_check clean AND python3 scripts/ci/octo_judge.py --container-log <container log> --profile
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-np1 clean (the solo rule beside the octo rules); the NP1 lines in the container log: "[NP1] kv scratch:
# Qwen36ForCausalLM.allocate_kv_cache allocates 1 block(s) beyond the pool vLLM sized (pool 16500 blocks, scratch ids 16500..16500)" once, "[SOLO-PACKED] admitted
# min_users=1 scratch_pages=16500 (gate only)" once and, for each of the two M3 blocks, "packed padded block admitted min_users=1 users=4 max_idle=4 ...
# scratch_pages=16500"; the octo block's own admitted line is unchanged (min_users=6, max_idle=2, no scratch pages). Then, after the four boots of the pair (C1 L1 C2 L2):
# python3 scripts/ci/np1_report.py --control-a <C1 smoke> --arm-a <L1 smoke> --control-b <C2 smoke> --arm-b <L2 smoke> --arm-container <L1 container> --arm-container <L2
# container> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-np1: per test the aggregate of the all-live window of the arm against the control's in BOTH pairs
# and the floors; GO needs a GAIN at np1_live1 and no LOSS elsewhere. The texts must be EQUAL, user by user: python3 scripts/ci/octo_compare.py --control <C1 smoke> --octo
# <L1 smoke> --octo-container <L1 container> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-np1 (and the same for C2 L2): the same checkpoint, greedy, so a
# difference is a token the lone-user round changed and is NO-GO. CHECKPOINT READ (the workflow passes c2_smoke_check.py --expect-checkpoint): the container log holds
# "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b@b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4 key=... weight_cache=.../weights-ckpt/<key> base_cache=... (the base cache is
# not read or written)" once, a "weight cache ...: found" line (the cache W0 of the Swift window built; this pack never builds it) and the worker's "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint
# bound ..." line; the models answer names ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b. TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1, scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the read-only ARC sidecar samples every
# chip once a second through the smoke step; the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. A rate difference that comes with a different loaded AICLK between the
# arms is the clocks, not the lever. Duration (estimate): 45 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-np1-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-np1
C2_MODEL_REPO=ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b
C2_MODEL_REVISION=b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,np1_live1,np1_live2,np1_live4,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=80
